  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "あつく　にえたぎる　みずを\nあいてに　はっしゃして　こうげきする。\nやけど　じょうたいに　することが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "뜨겁게 끓어오르는 물을\n상대에게 발사해서 공격한다.\n화상 상태로 만들 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "向對手噴射\n滾燙的熱水進行攻擊。\n有時會讓對手陷入灼傷狀態。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "L’ennemi est attaqué par un jet d’eau bouillante.\nPeut aussi le brûler.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Heizt dem Ziel mit einem Schwall siedend heißen\nKochwassers ein. Das Ziel erleidet dabei eventuell\nVerbrennungen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataca arrojando agua hirviendo al objetivo. Puede\ncausar quemaduras.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa attacca il bersaglio con un getto\nd’acqua bollente che può anche scottarlo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user shoots boiling hot water at its target.\nThis may also leave the target with a burn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "熱く　煮えたぎる　水を\n相手に　発射して　攻撃する。\nやけど状態に　することが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "向对手喷射煮得翻滚的开水进行攻击。\n有时会让对手陷入灼伤状态。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataca arrojando agua hirviendo al objetivo. Puede\ncausar quemaduras.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
